@startuml asset_state_diagram
!include ../../style.iuml
hide empty description
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam nodesep 70

state "Healthy" as Healthy
state "Warning" as Warning
state "Fault" as Fault
state "Under Maintenance" as UnderMaintenance
state "Inspection Required" as InspectionRequired
state "Decommissioned" as Decommissioned

[*] --> Healthy : asset registered

Healthy --> Fault : issue reported on the asset /\ninspection critical check fails
Healthy --> Warning : issue on hold /\ninspection answer "Needs attention"
Healthy --> InspectionRequired : IoT anomaly confirmed\n(debounce passed)

Fault --> UnderMaintenance : issue / work order\nin progress
Warning --> UnderMaintenance : issue / work order\nin progress
UnderMaintenance --> Warning : work put on hold

UnderMaintenance --> Healthy : issue resolved and no other\nopen issue or work order
Fault --> Healthy : sensor confirms normal operation\nand nothing else is open
Warning --> Healthy : sensor confirms normal operation\nand nothing else is open

InspectionRequired --> Healthy : readings recover /\ninspection finds no fault
InspectionRequired --> Fault : inspection confirms a fault

Healthy --> Decommissioned : staff sets state manually
Fault --> Decommissioned : staff sets state manually
@enduml
